{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-exo-18-1","title":"Exodus 18:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jethro brings his wife and two sons to Moses. 7 Moses entertains him, and relates the goodness of the Lord. 9 Jethro rejoices, blesses God, and offers sacrifice. 13 He gives good counsel, which is accepted. 27 Jethro departs.</p>\n<p>Jethro. 2:16,21; 3:1; 4:18; Nu 10:29; Jud 4:11 heard. Ps 34:2; 44:1; 77:14,15; 78:4; 105:5,43; 106:2,8; Jer 33:9; Zec 8:23 Ga 1:23,24 God. Ac 7:35,36; 14:27; 15:12; 21:19,20; Ro 15:18 done. 7:1-15:27; Jos 2:10; 9:9; Ne 9:10,11; Ps 77:14,15; 78:50-53 Ps 105:36-41; 106:8-11; 136:10-16; Isa 63:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-2","title":"Exodus 18:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Zipporah. 2:21; 4:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-3","title":"Exodus 18:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>two sons. Ac 7:29 Gershom. i.e., A stranger there. 2:22; Ps 39:12; Heb 11:13; 1Pe 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-4","title":"Exodus 18:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Eliezer. i.e., my God is an help. Ps 46:1; Isa 50:7-9; Heb 13:6 delivered. 2:15; Ps 18:1; *title Ps 18:48; 34:4; Da 6:22; Ac 12:11; 2Co 1:8-10; 2Ti 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-5","title":"Exodus 18:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>3:1,12; 19:11,20; 24:16,17; 1Ki 19:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-7","title":"Exodus 18:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>went. Ge 14:17; 46:29; Nu 22:36; Jud 11:34; 1Ki 2:19; Ac 28:15 did obeisance. Ge 18:2; 19:1; 33:3-7 kissed. Ge 29:13; 31:28; 33:4; 45:15; Ps 2:12; Lu 7:45; Ac 20:37 welfare. Heb. peace. Ge 43:27; 2Sa 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-8","title":"Exodus 18:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>told. 1; Ne 9:9-15; Ps 66:16; 71:17-20; 105:1,2; 145:4-12 and all the. 15:22-24; 16:3 come upon them. Heb found them. Ge 44:34; Nu 20:14; Ne 9:32; *marg: how the Lord. Ps 78:42,43; 81:7; 106:10; 107:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-9","title":"Exodus 18:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Isa 44:23; 66:10; Ro 12:10,15; 1Co 12:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-10","title":"Exodus 18:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ge 14:20; 2Sa 18:28; 1Ki 8:15; Ps 41:13; 106:47,48; Lu 1:68 Eph 1:3; 1Th 3:9; 1Pe 1:3; Re 5:11-13; 19:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-11","title":"Exodus 18:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Now I. 9:16; 1Ki 17:24; 2Ki 5:15 the Lord. 15:11; 1Ch 16:25; 2Ch 2:5; Ps 95:3; 97:9; 135:5 in the thing. 1:10,16,22; 5:2,7; 14:8,18 proudly. 9:17; 10:3; 1Sa 2:3; Ne 9:10,16,29; Job 40:11,12; Ps 31:23 Ps 119:21; Da 4:37; Lu 1:51; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-12","title":"Exodus 18:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>took. 24:5; Ge 4:4; 8:20; 12:7; 26:25; 31:54; Job 1:5; 42:8 Aaron. 24:11; Le 7:11-17; De 12:7; 27:7; 1Ch 29:21,22; 2Ch 30:22 1Co 10:18,21,31 eat bread. 2:20; Ge 43:25; 2Sa 9:7; Job 42:11; Da 10:3; Lu 14:1,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-13","title":"Exodus 18:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Jud 5:10; Job 29:7; Isa 16:5; Joe 3:12; Mt 23:2; Ro 12:8; 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-15","title":"Exodus 18:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>to enquire. 19,20; Le 24:12-14; Nu 15:34; 27:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-16","title":"Exodus 18:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a matter. 23:7; 24:14; De 17:8-12; 2Sa 15:3; Job 31:13; Ac 18:14,15 1Co 6:1 one and another. Heb. a man and his fellow. 2:13 make. Le 24:15; Nu 15:35; 27:6-11; 36:6-9; De 4:5; 5:1; 6:1; 1Sa 12:23 Mt 28:20; 1Th 4:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-18","title":"Exodus 18:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Thou wilt surely wear away. Heb. Fading thou wilt fade. 2Co 12:15; Php 2:30; 1Th 2:8,9 thou art. Nu 11:14-17; De 1:9-12; Ac 6:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-19","title":"Exodus 18:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Hearken. 24; Pr 9:9 God shall. 3:12; 4:12; Ge 39:2; De 20:1; Jos 1:9; 2Sa 14:17; Mt 28:20 Be thou. 15; 4:16; 20:19; De 5:5 bring. Nu 27:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-20","title":"Exodus 18:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>teach. 16; De 4:1,5; 5:1; 6:1,2; 7:11; Ne 9:13,14 the way. 1Sa 12:23; Ps 32:8; 143:8; Isa 30:21; Jer 6:16; 42:3; Mic 4:2 1Th 4:1 work. De 1:18; Eze 3:17; Mt 28:20; Mr 13:34; 2Th 3:6-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-21","title":"Exodus 18:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Moreover. De 1:13-17; Ac 6:3 able men. 25; De 16:18; 1Ki 3:9-12; Pr 28:2 such as. 23:2-9; Ge 22:12; 42:18; 2Sa 23:3; 1Ki 18:3,12; 2Ch 19:5-10 Ne 5:9; 7:2; Ec 12:13; Lu 18:2,4 men. Job 29:16; 31:13; Isa 16:5; 59:4,14,15; Jer 5:1; Eze 18:8; Zec 7:9 Zec 8:16 hating. 23:8; De 16:18,19; 1Sa 8:3; 12:3,4; Ps 26:9,10; Isa 33:15 Eze 22:12; Ac 20:33; 1Ti 3:3; 6:9-11; 2Pe 2:14,15 rulers of thousands.Whatever matter the {decarch,} or ruler over ten, could not decide, went to the {pentecontarch,} or ruler of fifty, and thence by degrees to the {hecatontarch,} or ruler over a hundred, to the {chiliarch,} or ruler over a thousand, to Moses, and at length to God himself. Each magistrate had the care or inspection of only ten men; the {decarch} superintended ten private characters; the {hecatontarch} ten {decarchs;} and the {chiliarch,} ten {hecatontarchs.}</p>\n<p>Nu 10:4; De 1:15; Jos 22:14; 1Sa 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-22","title":"Exodus 18:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>at all seasons. 26; Ro 13:6 great. Le 24:11; Nu 15:33; 27:2; 36:1; De 1:17; 17:8,9 they shall. 18; Nu 11:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-23","title":"Exodus 18:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>God. 18; Ge 21:10-12; 1Sa 8:6,7,22; Ac 15:2; Ga 2:2 and all this. 16:29; Ge 18:33; 30:25; 2Sa 18:3; 19:39; 21:17; Php 1:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-24","title":"Exodus 18:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>2-5,19; Ezr 10:2,5; Pr 1:5; 1Co 12:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-25","title":"Exodus 18:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>21; De 1:15; Ac 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-26","title":"Exodus 18:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>at all. 14,22 the hard causes. 15,22; De 17:8; 1Ki 3:16-28; 10:1; Job 29:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-18-27","title":"Exodus 18:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Ge 24:59; 31:55; Nu 10:29,30; Jud 19:9</p>"}]}